 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Effective communication with Chinese suppliers is a learned skill that directly impacts your sourcing success. Clear, detailed communication prevents costly misunderstandings about specs, pricing, and delivery timelines. <strong>Sample cost benchmarks for OEM charger sourcing:</strong> standard ODM samples typically cost <strong>$50-$150 per unit</strong> with 3-7 day turnaround and $50-$100 express shipping; custom OEM samples run <strong>$200-$500 per unit</strong> with 7-15 day turnaround due to tooling setup. Always budget $300-$800 total for a complete sample evaluation round (2-3 units including express shipping). Here's how to navigate the process from first email to sample approval:</p>

