 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">A realistic timeline helps you plan inventory and product launches. Most first-time buyers underestimate the total time required. This is especially true when custom tooling or certification is involved. Here's a typical 10-12 week journey when sourcing from China, assuming smooth communication and no major issues:</p>

